      "instance_name": "proud_truck_owner_scene",
      "label": "Proud Dodge Ram truck owner standing beside his vehicle",
      "description": "A middle-aged man, identified as the Dodge Ram truck owner, stands confidently beside his red Dodge Ram pickup truck in a public setting. He is gesturing with his hand, embodying the stereotype of a proud truck owner. The truck is prominently displayed, and the man's posture and expression suggest he is unwilling to be photographed, as implied by the meme's text. The scene is set in an urban environment with a parade or public event in the background, including people on horseback and spectators.",
