      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "internet_meme_format",
      "label": "Internet Meme Format",
      "description": "The format of the meme — using a humorous caption to describe a person's behavior in a specific context — is a common structure in internet memes. This format relies on the audience's familiarity with meme culture to understand the joke. The phrase 'dodge owners be like' is a typical way to introduce a stereotype or behavior associated with a group.",
