      "description": "The top text 'dodge owners be like' maps to the visual entity 'man: Dodge Ram truck owner', who is depicted standing confidently beside his vehicle, embodying the stereotype of a proud Dodge Ram owner. The meme uses this visual representation to humorously suggest that Dodge owners are so proud of their trucks that they don't want to be photographed, as indicated by the bottom text.",
